    "citation": "Rovny, Polk, Bakker, Hooghe, Jolly, Marks, Steenbergen and Vachudova (2025). 25 Years of Political Party Positions in Europe: The Chapel Hill Expert Survey, 1999-2024. Electoral Studies."
